        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Reference class and base rate: the official DOL table shows the last 12 CCSA prints clustered tightly from 1.771 million to 1.821 million, centered around roughly 1.79 million. That range is the main outside-view anchor because the target is only three weekly continued-claims observations beyond the latest available print."
